Third-party components
----------------------
OpenLearn links the following libraries. None of them restricts the licence of
this program, and each keeps its own terms:

  FastAPI, Starlette, Uvicorn .................. BSD-3-Clause
  SQLAlchemy, Pydantic, PyJWT, httpx ........... MIT
  markdown-it-py, python-multipart ............. MIT
  argon2-cffi, nh3, PyMySQL, python3-saml ...... MIT
  Pillow ...................................... MIT-CMU
  reportlab ................................... BSD-3-Clause
  psycopg ..................................... LGPL-3.0-only

psycopg is linked as a separate library and loaded at runtime: it can be
replaced by another driver without touching this code, which is what section 4
of the LGPL requires.

  axe-core 4.10.2 (tools/axe, tests only) ...... MPL-2.0

axe-core is vendored rather than fetched from a CDN so the accessibility audit
runs offline and always uses the version this repository names. No page served by
OpenLearn loads it; see tools/axe/README.md.

The demo catalogue under demo/ is original content, written for this project and
released under the same licence as the code.
